 mlir/lib/Bytecode/Reader/BytecodeReader.cpp   | 137 +++++++-----------
 .../invalid-attr_type_section-cycle.mlirbc    | Bin 0 -> 154 bytes
 .../invalid/invalid_attr_type_section.mlir    |   7 +
 ...op_with_properties_deeply_nested_attr.mlir |   8 +
 4 files changed, 71 insertions(+), 81 deletions(-)

